  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0076:b002:l038": "Бузду жаман санааны literally broke the evil intention; narrative relation to the rejoicing captors remains uncertain. No emendation.",
    "manas-2010:p0076:b002:l042": "Көөнү тыныптыр rendered hearts grew calm; apparent contrast with Muslim distress nearby retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0077:b002:l001": "Karykan is the visible subject in this passage; sending the diviner back to Karykan later appears circular. No silent change of name or subject.",
    "manas-2010:p0077:b002:l003": "Теңи interpreted half in the bronze/copper idol description; exact composition and syntax uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0077:b002:l011": "Кендеме retained kendeme. Palace/building context clear but precise object/architectural gloss unresolved after dictionary search.",
    "manas-2010:p0077:b002:l014": "Кен-Тун retained Ken-Tun; relationship to Кенинин in the following line uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0077:b002:l019": "Stone supplied from preceding wall description; таштап here is a verb, not independently a noun for stone.",
    "manas-2010:p0077:b002:l026": "Ашпай-шашпай literally unhurriedly; could be heard without fail is provisional contextual interpretation.",
    "manas-2010:p0079:b002:l034": "Өпкө чабар literally striking with lungs, retained as ritual action; precise practice not independently established.",
    "manas-2010:p0079:b002:l046": "Башым жок literally I have no head; no heir follows childlessness context.",
    "manas-2010:p0080:b002:l012": "Five nines retained as five groups of nine with mare heads; no collapsed arithmetic. https://el-sozduk.kg/toguz-2/",
    "manas-2010:p0080:b002:l014": "Four nines headed by camels retained. https://el-sozduk.kg/toguz-2/",
    "manas-2010:p0080:b002:l043": "Young barchyn is the visible expression, although barchyn describes an eagle after its sixth molt. Source age tension retained. https://el-sozduk.kg/barchyn-i/",
    "manas-2010:p0081:b002:l011": "Eighty-four jesses/tethers is the explicit dream number, not normalized.",
    "manas-2010:p0081:b002:l022": "Капчыгай literally ravine; strange action retained as dream imagery.",
    "manas-2010:p0081:b002:l034": "Зулпукор retained Zulpukor, the epic sword name associated with Zulfiqar; no new weapon characteristics supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0082:b002:l035": "Чакмак уруп interpreted striking sparks/flint; an alternative game-related sense is not excluded.",
    "manas-2010:p0082:b002:l040": "Уксуз rendered unknown; unusual visible form not emended.",
    "manas-2010:p0082:b002:l048": "Saint designation may refer to Akbaltay or the naked boy; English leaves the sequence intact.",
    "manas-2010:p0083:b002:l013": "Сары адырмак шыбыргак provisionally yellow hills swept by sleet; exact topographic formula uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0083:b002:l015": "Birthcloths supplied for the birth-place idiom about washing and cutting the cord.",
    "manas-2010:p0084:b002:l025": "Кул rendered servant; not softened into lad.",
    "manas-2010:p0084:b002:l038": "Kakanchyn and Bakburchun retained as visible epic names; identities not independently established.",
    "manas-2010:p0085:b002:l020": "Датың provisionally proclamation; lament or renown may fit the opaque construction.",
    "manas-2010:p0085:b002:l025": "Санат кылат rendered memorable deeds; precise force uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0085:b002:l041": "Youngest of six lions retained without supplying identities.",
    "manas-2010:p0086:b002:l015": "Little camel-calf is an affectionate child metaphor, retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0086:b002:l016": "Безге сайган literally piercing a gland, rendered as an irritation idiom; exact image uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0086:b002:l035": "Куу катын rendered barren wife in context; contemptuous source epithet retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0086:b002:l042": "The horse becoming a stranger is the visible question; no silent correction.",
    "manas-2010:p0086:b002:l047": "Asyy retained traditional horse age unit; first asyy starts at five years, not synonymous with year. https://el-sozduk.kg/asyy-4/",
    "manas-2010:p0087:b002:l017": "Seven tümen retained epic count unit, without pretending a census.",
    "manas-2010:p0088:b002:l037": "Малдан ашты баарды interpreted opening bounty from the herds; ашты may represent ачты. Raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0089:b002:l008": "Kochku called Chinese here, Kalmyk at79:4; discrepancy retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0089:b002:l032": "Leave me two and take one retains explicit numbers; referents are not securely resolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0089:b002:l034": "Кызыл куйрук билимди provisionally red-tailed elephants, interpreting бил as a pil/elephant variant. Visible билимди is lexically problematic; unresolved specialist-review blocker, raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0090:b002:l023": "Бүлкүлдөгөн interpreted whispering/betraying the secret from oath context.",
    "manas-2010:p0090:b002:l040": "Chewing white wheat flour retained literally; pledge supplied from surrounding collective oath.",
    "manas-2010:p0091:b002:l009": "Five nines retained as groups of nine. https://el-sozduk.kg/toguz-2/",
