    "manas-2010:p0092:b002:l043": "Алтын сан rendered golden san literally. Possible defect for алты сан (six san) not silently corrected; unresolved numeral reading.",
    "manas-2010:p0093:b002:l014": "Kambar Ata is the horse patron invoked in the stallion sacrifice; no historical identification asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p0093:b002:l017": "Кисе is a belt with pouches; neck placement is attested ritual wording. https://el-sozduk.kg/КИСЕ/",
